      "key": "summer_Sun",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Emily usually cooks dinner... But she makes weird stuff like quinoa.",
      "translation": "Večeři obvykle vaří Emily... Ale dělá divná jídla, třeba quinou.",
      "sourceSHA256": "d5d1f011ec45c9384021b73abc319b9c9e0068af3219937500ca7b6c9917eedb",
      "translationSHA256": "ddce4011a0982e238451f728a83dae3325a34607ea5020693e5c8be7eeb917f0",
      "reviewChecks": [
