    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Haley",
      "key": "summer_Thu6",
      "field": null,
      "source": "If you stay in the sun a lot it will make your hair lighter... But you don't want to get sunburnt, either.#$e#I just want a healthy amount of sunlight. Everything in moderation, right?",
      "translation": "Když budeš trávit hodně času na slunci, zesvětlí ti vlasy... Ale zároveň se nechceš spálit.#$e#Chci jen přiměřenou dávku slunečního světla. Všeho s mírou, že?",
      "sourceSHA256": "d8f091fcfb102d7ae3e697550e4c43b069f6e43046244e94befe715bab60edc7",
      "translationSHA256": "170f54df1516651a989b697da853fa800e9ee37a566ab1207667b4393e672998",
      "reviewChecks": [
